      regle: "Pour répondre en donnant son avis, on dit I think ou I don't think suivi d'une réponse courte : Do you think she is French ? Yes, I think she is. / No, I don't think she is. On reprend l'auxiliaire de la question (is, does, did, can, has). Dans un dialogue, on change de personne : Do you think I am right ? Yes, I think you are.",
